WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.833
Step 1: Open Learning centre → In-store training. Use the location, search and status filters to find your training.

2
00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:19.583
Step 2: With training assignment access, choose + New checklist or Edit to open the checklist builder page. Add steps such as competency ratings, supervised attempts, checkboxes and Course steps, check the phone preview, then press Save checklist.

3
00:00:19.583 --> 00:00:30.458
Step 3: Choose + New training. Pick the training checklist (its title becomes the training title), then set the location, trainer, date, Melbourne start time, duration and staff, and press Create training.

4
00:00:30.458 --> 00:00:42.292
Step 4: Open View training and choose a staff member. Complete the steps with them and press Save assessment. They are signed off once every required step is done and every course step is passed.
